# hugmesh-vpn-reconcile — egress-VPN convergence timer (60s default).
#
# The TIMER half of the egress-VPN reconcile (the OpenRC service runs the agent
# once at boot; this cron entry re-runs it every 60s). cronie reads /etc/cron.d
# (the same mechanism provision.sh uses for /etc/cron.d/hugmesh-backup +
# hugmesh-device-registry-sync). Installed ONLY when the egress-VPN optional
# service is selected (PR6 gate).
#
# The agent is FAIL-CLOSED + idempotent: a failed fetch/verify keeps the last-good
# cache + leaves the running tunnel as-is; a successful one writes the Secret-backed
# config, flips active.conf, restarts the service + leak-checks. The authoritative
# fast path is the BFF; this pull is the convergence FLOOR for missed pushes /
# reboots.
#
# Field order: min hour dom month dow user command
* * * * * root /usr/sbin/hugmesh-vpn-reconcile >> /var/log/hugmesh-vpn-reconcile.log 2>&1
